@startuml
title FIFO: request, wait, grant and release

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 140

participant "Philosopher P0" as P0
participant "Philosopher P1" as P1
participant "Critical section\n+ central queue" as CS
participant "Event(req0)" as E0

P0 -> CS: lock()
P0 -> CS: enqueue(req0)
CS -> CS: dispatch_locked()
CS --> P0: req0 = WAITING\nunlock()
P0 -> E0: sem_timedwait(timeout)

note over P0,E0: P0 is blocked until\nthe request is granted\nor the timeout expires

P1 -> CS: lock()
P1 -> CS: release both forks
CS -> CS: dispatch_locked()\nhead = req0
CS -> CS: grant(req0)\nowners assigned
CS -> E0: sem_post()
CS --> P1: unlock()

E0 --> P0: wake up
P0 -> CS: lock()
CS --> P0: req0 = GRANTED
CS --> P0: unlock()
P0 -> P0: EATING

P0 -> CS: lock()
P0 -> CS: release both forks\ndispatch_locked()
CS --> P0: unlock()
P0 -> P0: THINKING

@enduml
